msgstr "Alerte de faible solde"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1463
msgid ""
"Email the user when their credit balance drops below this amount. Set to 0 "
"to disable."
msgstr ""
"Envoyer un e-mail à l'utilisateur quand son solde de Credits tombe "
"au-dessous de ce montant. Réglez sur 0 pour désactiver."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1468
