msgstr "ou"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1531
msgid "one of"
msgstr "l'un des"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1531
msgid ""
"`credits` = exact number to add. `amount` = currency value (multiplied by "
"your Credit Rate setting). At least one must be > 0."
msgstr ""
"`credits` = nombre exact à ajouter. `amount` = valeur en devise (multipliée "
"par votre paramètre Taux des Credits). Au moins un doit être > 0."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1532
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1533
msgid "recommended"
msgstr "recommandé"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1532
msgid "Provider transaction reference, stored on the ledger row for reconciliation."
msgstr ""
"Référence de transaction du fournisseur, stockée dans la ligne du journal "
"pour la réconciliation."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1533
msgid "or your own slug."
msgstr "ou votre propre slug."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1534
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1535
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1536
msgid "optional"
msgstr "facultatif"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1534
msgid ""
"If set, also assigns the matching Pricing Plan + applies its "
"featured/duration perks."
msgstr ""
"S'il est défini, attribue également le plan tarifaire correspondant + "
"applique ses avantages featured/duration."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1535
msgid "Defaults to `payment.completed`. Used in audit-log entries."
msgstr ""
"Valeurs par défaut : `payment.completed`. Utilisé dans les entrées du "
"journal d'audit."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1536
msgid ""
"Unix seconds inside the payload (separate from the header). Lets you sign "
"payloads without sending the header — handy for providers that strip custom "
"headers."
msgstr ""
"Secondes Unix dans la charge utile (séparée de l'en-tête). Vous permet de "
"signer les charges utiles sans envoyer l'en-tête — pratique pour les "
"fournisseurs qui suppriment les en-têtes personnalisés."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1540
msgid "Stripe"
msgstr "Stripe"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1542
msgid "Stripe Dashboard → Developers → Webhooks → Add endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Tableau de bord Stripe → Développeurs → Webhooks → Ajouter un point de "
"terminaison."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1543
msgid ""
"Paste the Webhook URL above; subscribe to event "
"`checkout.session.completed` (or `payment_intent.succeeded` if you use raw "
"PaymentIntents)."
msgstr ""
"Collez l'URL du Webhook ci-dessus ; abonnez-vous à l'événement "
"`checkout.session.completed` (ou `payment_intent.succeeded` si vous "
"utilisez des PaymentIntents bruts)."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1544
msgid ""
"Stripe signs with its own header (`Stripe-Signature`). Listora does NOT "
"read that header — you need a tiny relay (Cloudflare Worker, custom "
"mu-plugin, or Pipedream) that re-signs Stripe's payload as "
"`<timestamp>.<body>` with the Listora secret and POSTs here. A 20-line "
"example lives in `docs/integrations/stripe-relay.md`."
msgstr ""
"Stripe signe avec son propre en-tête (`Stripe-Signature`). Listora ne lit "
"PAS cet en-tête — vous avez besoin d'un petit relais (Cloudflare Worker, "
"mu-plugin personnalisé ou Pipedream) qui re-signe la charge utile de Stripe "
"en tant que `<timestamp>.<body>` avec le secret Listora et envoie un POST "
"ici. Un exemple de 20 lignes se trouve dans "
"`docs/integrations/stripe-relay.md`."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1545
msgid "In the relay, map Stripe fields → Listora fields:"
msgstr "Dans le relais, mappez les champs Stripe → champs Listora :"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1548
msgid "PayPal"
msgstr "PayPal"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1550
msgid ""
"PayPal Developer Dashboard → My Apps & Credentials → your app → Webhooks → "
"Add webhook."
msgstr ""
"Tableau de bord PayPal Developer → Mes applications et identifiants → votre "
"application → Webhooks → Ajouter un webhook."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1551
msgid ""
"Webhook URL = your relay endpoint (PayPal posts IPN-style notifications "
"that need translating to the Listora payload shape)."
msgstr ""
"URL du Webhook = votre point de terminaison de relais (PayPal envoie des "
"notifications de style IPN qui doivent être traduites dans la forme de "
"charge utile Listora)."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1552
msgid ""
"Subscribe to `PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED` (REST API) or use IPN with "
"`txn_type=web_accept` / `payment_status=Completed`."
msgstr ""
"S'abonner à `PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED` (API REST) ou utiliser IPN avec "
"`txn_type=web_accept` / `payment_status=Completed`."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1553
msgid "Relay maps:"
msgstr "Mappages de relais :"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1556
msgid "WooCommerce (same site)"
msgstr "WooCommerce (même site)"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1558
msgid ""
"Easiest path: skip the webhook entirely. Install the matching credit "
"adapter under Listora → Settings → Credits → Credit Mappings; the SDK reads "
"WooCommerce order completion directly and tops up credits in-process."
msgstr ""
"Chemin le plus simple : ignorez le webhook entièrement. Installez "
"l'adaptateur de crédit correspondant sous Listora → Paramètres → Credits → "
"Mappages des Credits ; le SDK lit l'achèvement de la commande WooCommerce "
"directement et recharge les Credits en traitement."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1559
msgid ""
"Alternative (cross-site WC): wire WooCommerce → Settings → Advanced → "
"Webhooks → Add webhook. Topic `Order updated`. Delivery URL = the Listora "
"Webhook URL above. Add a small `woocommerce_webhook_payload` filter that "
"emits the Listora payload shape with the order's `billing_email`, `total`, "
"`id`, and `\"woocommerce\"`."
msgstr ""
"Alternative (WC entre sites) : connectez WooCommerce → Paramètres → Avancé "
"→ Webhooks → Ajouter un webhook. Sujet `Order updated`. URL de livraison = "
"l'URL du Webhook Listora ci-dessus. Ajoutez un petit filtre "
"`woocommerce_webhook_payload` qui émet la forme de charge utile Listora "
"avec l'e-mail de facturation, le total, l'ID et `\"woocommerce\"` de la "
"commande."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1562
msgid "Test it works (curl)"
msgstr "Testez son fonctionnement (curl)"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1563
msgid ""
"Run this from a terminal to confirm the endpoint accepts a signed request. "
"Replace `<SECRET>` with the Webhook Secret above."
msgstr ""
"Exécutez ceci à partir d'un terminal pour confirmer que le point de "
"terminaison accepte une demande signée. Remplacez `<SECRET>` par le secret "
"du Webhook ci-dessus."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1572
msgid ""
"Expected response: HTTP 200 with "
"`{\"success\":true,\"credits_added\":10,...}`. Errors return a JSON body "
"with `code` and `message` — check the Audit Log (Listora → Audit Log) for "
"rejection reasons."
msgstr ""
"Réponse attendue : HTTP 200 avec "
"`{\"success\":true,\"credits_added\":10,...}`. Les erreurs retournent un "
"corps JSON avec `code` et `message` — consultez le journal d'audit (Listora "
"→ Journal d'audit) pour les raisons de rejet."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1580
msgid "Related screens"
msgstr "Écrans associés"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1581
msgid ""
"Quick access to credit-related data screens. Mappings now live on this same "
"tab below; these buttons jump to the rows-and-history surfaces."
msgstr ""
"Accès rapide aux écrans de données liés aux Credits. Les mappages se "
"trouvent maintenant dans cet onglet ci-dessous ; ces boutons accèdent aux "
"surfaces des lignes et de l'historique."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1586
msgid "Transactions"
msgstr "Transactions"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1590
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1595
msgid "View Transaction Log"
msgstr "Afficher le journal des transactions"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1592
msgid "Per-user credit ledger with filters and CSV export."
msgstr "Journal des Credits par utilisateur avec filtres et export CSV."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1597
msgid ""
"The transaction log requires WB Listora Pro with monetization enabled. It "
"appears here once monetization is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Le journal des transactions nécessite WB Listora Pro avec la monétisation "
"activée. Il apparaît ici une fois la monétisation activée."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1602
msgid "Pricing plans"
msgstr "Plans tarifaires"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1606
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1611
msgid "Manage Pricing Plans"
msgstr "Gérer les plans tarifaires"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1608
msgid ""
"Bundle credits + listing limits into named plans assigned at submission "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Regroupez les Credits + les limites de Listing dans des plans nommés "
"attribués au moment de la soumission."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1613
msgid ""
"Pricing plans require WB Listora Pro with monetization enabled. The plans "
"manager appears here once monetization is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Les plans tarifaires nécessitent WB Listora Pro avec la monétisation "
"activée. Le gestionnaire des plans apparaît ici une fois la monétisation "
"activée."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1655
